
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
build instructions and flash process
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
this project uses CMAKE.

run the cmake and keep build directory outside of src directory for ease of use and run make flash.
while having your stm32 powered up in boot mode.

if using dev kit the boot pin should be pulled high using the jumper and flash.

make files uses stm32flash , so have that installed in your system.

it assumes you are using UART connection. make sure the usb-uart covertor is connected to UART1 of stm32

////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

